---
description: Approved tests are a contract
globs: "**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Approved tests are a contract once `.claude/tests.lock` exists. The hook blocks edits while that file exists. After the owner approves a spec change, delete the lock, change the spec and the tests together, then lock again. If the spec did not change, stop and report.

Test behaviour, not markup. A bug fix starts with a regression test that fails on `main`.

Component tests that need HTTP register handlers with `server.use` from `src/test/msw/server.ts`.
